cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
title: "GynRepanel: Gynecologic Multi-Omic Cross-Cohort Benchmark"
abstract: >
  GynRepanel implements a three-paradigm multi-omic integration benchmark for
  gynecologic malignancies (OV/UCEC/CESC) with undecidability classification
  per SPIRIT 2013. It provides the layer-dose response curve (2→5 omics layers),
  the NRCR 20-item reproducibility scaffold, the MDD-based undecidability
  classifier (purity gate G2), and the RAINBO ProMisE/CN_LOW mis-calibration
  quantification utility.
